Typical macro tower parameters:

    Transmit power: 43-46 dBm (20-40 watts) per carrier
    Antenna gain: 15-18 dBi
    Path loss at 500 meters, 700 MHz: approximately 100-110 dB
    Device antenna gain: 0 dBi

