This tool is limited — it's a session/fix tool, not a raw UBX configuration tool. It cannot enable GLONASS or configure message outputs directly. It wraps the u-blox positioning API, not the CFG layer.
What It Can Do For Us Right Now

The continuous command starts a continuous fix session and outputs NMEA — which is still evidentiary logging.
