-P 1 = 1 second preferred interval -v = verbose output Redirect both stdout and stderr to file

This runs indefinitely. Ctrl+C to stop.
But For Full UBX Configuration — We Need A Different Approach

The right tool for raw UBX packet sending on Windows without Packet Console is Python with pyserial. It is a 10-minute setup and gives you complete control over every UBX-CFG register.
