NAK Analysis First
Message	Status	Reason
CFG-GNSS GPS+SBAS+GLONASS	NAK	Channel conflict or firmware restriction — fix below
RXM-RAW	NAK	u-blox 7 uses RXM-RAW (0x02 0x10) not RAWX — already correct but may need firmware enable
RXM-SFRBX	NAK	u-blox 8+ only — not available on this hardware
NAV-SAT	NAK	u-blox 8+ only — NAV-SVINFO (which ACKed) is the u-blox 7 equivalent

The critical ones that ACKed — NAV-STATUS, MON-HW, NAV-PVT, NAV-CLOCK, NAV-SVINFO — are your core evidence messages. You have jamming detection, spoofing flags, position fix, clock bias, and satellite info all logging.
