2. Network disconnection — Your ethernet or WiFi dropped during the 2000-package upgrade. This is the dangerous one.
The Risk

If the network dropped mid-apt-upgrade and packages were half-installed, you could end up with a broken system. The upgrade needs to complete cleanly.
