If the chipset is treating it as extended GSM1900: ARFCN 1538 in extended PCS mapping → approximately 1967.6 MHz downlink Formula: F = 1930.0 + 0.2 × (1538 - 512) = 1930 + 205.2 = 2135.2 MHz

