Architecture

Four simultaneous threads — one per adapter. Band assignment is automatic: 2 adapters on 2.4 GHz (all 14 channels including 12/13/14), 2 adapters on 5 GHz (all 25 channels from 36-165). With just the ALFA you get one thread; add the TP-Link and you get 2.

