Seven real-time detection rules:

    SSID_CLONE_FLOOD — same SSID from more than 2 BSSIDs
    SSID_PATTERN_FLOOD — SpectrumSetup-XXXX pattern, more than 2 variants
    EPHEMERAL_STRONG_AP — above -85 dBm, present under 120 seconds, then gone
    RSSI_MANIPULATION — 10+ dBm change between epochs on same BSSID
    TX_POWER_MANIPULATION — TX power field change when RadioTap provides it
