    ILLEGAL_CHANNEL — any AP on ch12/13/14
    KNOWN_SSID_ILLEGAL_CHANNEL — your specific SSID on an illegal channel
    OPEN_AP — AP broadcasting with no WPA2
    UNSOLICITED_PROBE_RESPONSE — AP responding to devices that never probed it

