Architecture

The sentinel is technology-agnostic by design. It does not care whether the signal is WiFi, cellular, GNSS, radiation, or raw RF. It only cares about three behavioral parameters: did a signal cross 3× its individual baseline, did it do so at the same time as another signal from a different source, and what was the timing relationship.

