EARFCN 1000 Is Unambiguously a US Band

EARFCN 1000 maps to Band 2 (PCS 1900), downlink center 1970.0 MHz, per 3GPP TS 36.101 Table 5.7.3-1. Band 2 is governed by FCC Part 24 — the Broadband PCS spectrum auctioned between 1994 and 1997. It is one of the most heavily deployed LTE frequencies in the United States. T-Mobile, AT&T, and Verizon all hold PCS licenses covering Riverside County. T-Mobile is the dominant Band 2 operator in your market.

